wn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5934437)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirius-dawn" >Sirius Dawn</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>恭喜。——<span class="error-inline"><em>LeonTeflon</em> 不匹配任何一个现有的用户名</span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>？呼唤我？懂了，苹果，来做吧（肯定）。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285604&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532" alt="Chris Evertworth" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285604)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth" >Chris Evertworth</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><tt><em>人生最大的悲哀莫过于，你以为你在别人人事里是个狠人物，结果是个吃货 ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maybe-abs" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5540157&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532" alt="Maybe-ABS" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5540157)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maybe-abs" >Maybe-ABS</a></span></em></tt></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>留个言，别人的人事真有意思。――<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4423816&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532" alt="Dr_Naxurt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4423816)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt" >Dr_Naxurt</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>8说了，不愧是苹果。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5992128&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532" alt="Swred" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5992128)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred" >Swred</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>事钻苹果，爱了（ ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5375092&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532" alt="RainTree" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5375092)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree" >RainTree</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>钻苹果，噗嗤，整个人事都好好玩哈哈哈哈——路过的<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>别人的人事真有意思，再回头看看自己的都是些什么鬼东西&#8230;&#8230;——ID和头像都很应景的过路人<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5150580&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532" alt="MrPasserby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5150580)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrpasserby" >MrPasserby</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>唔，不知道说啥的我，只是想来蹭个人事页，真的很有意思。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krampus-of-error" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6050311&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532" alt="Krampus of Error" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6050311)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krampus-of-error" >Krampus of Error</a></span></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>有一说一，钻苹果蛮不错的（蹭人事）——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href=