&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;欢迎留言&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7027379&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532&quot; alt=&quot;Keyest&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7027379)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest&quot;  &gt;Keyest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;：过往留言已归档，查看回复请见工具盒tab页。这里是留言板！可以用作：闲聊/建议/询问我给出评分的原因等等，我都会回复。此处会不定期清空，所以务必随意&lt;span class=&quot;ruby&quot;&gt;编辑&lt;span class=&quot;rt&quot;&gt;瞎 搞&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;。当然也欢迎站内私信！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7027379&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609574532&quot; alt=&quot;Keyest&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7027379)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest&quot;  &gt;Keyest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;：生存即繁衍，我即番茄汤。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;#32;[[*user&amp;#32;你的ID]]：这是用来复制的留言格式。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
